<title>USA: VF still bullish on intimate apparel.</title>
<headline>VF still bullish on intimate apparel.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>VF Corp, which earlier announced it had ended talks to acquire privately-held Maidenform Worldwide Inc, said it remains bullish on the outlook for the intimate apparel business.</p>
<p>&quot;It's one of the categories we've targeted for growth. This doesn't change our strategy one way or the other,&quot; said spokeswoman Cindy Knoebel.</p>
<p>The two companies did not disclose the reason why the talks fell apart.</p>
<p>Shares of VF rose 1/2 to 68.</p>
<p>((--Robin Sidel, 212/859-1723))</p>
